<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 700 mln pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 700 mln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 700 million pounds for auction on July 14 and issue on July 15 when 182-day bills worth 709.575 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 8.83 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 Egyptian pounds)</p>
</text>
